    <td>N18.31</td><td>S — Synthetic kidney findings anchored to the documented nephritis and death from kidney disease.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-5">
    <td>Hyperlipidemia: LDL 174 mg/dL; 10-year ASCVD risk 7.9% by the Pooled Cohort Equations (intermediate)</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>E78.5</td><td>S — Synthetic laboratory finding.</td>
  </tr></tbody></table></text>

